    out property <string> clipboard-footnote: chinese ? "所有内容仅保存在内存中  ·  关闭窗口即清空  ·  自动收集默认关闭，且不会写入磁盘  ·  最多保留 60 条 / 128 MiB" : "Held in memory only  ·  Emptied when the window closes  ·  Automatic collecting is off by default and nothing is written to disk  ·  Up to 60 items and 128 MiB";
