    out property <string> archives-going-in: chinese ? "将被打包" : "Going in";
    out property <string> archives-going-in-caption: chinese ? " / 勾选要打包的内容" : " / tick what to pack";
    out property <string> archives-reading: chinese ? " / 正在读取…" : " / Reading…";
    out property <string> archives-tick-all: chinese ? "全选 / 全不选" : "Tick all";
    out property <string> archives-extract: chinese ? "解压勾选…" : "Extract ticked…";
    out property <string> archives-create: chinese ? "创建压缩包…" : "Create archive…";
    out property <string> archives-stop: chinese ? "停止" : "Stop";
    out property <string> archives-empty-title: chinese ? "先看看里面有什么" : "Start by looking inside";
    out property <string> archives-empty-hint: chinese ? "压缩包里的内容会逐条列在这里，勾选后才会解压。\n选择一个 ZIP 或 7z 文件，读取会自动开始。" : "Everything the archive holds is listed here, and nothing is unpacked until you tick it.\nChoose a ZIP or 7z file, and the reading starts on its own.";
    out property <string> archives-pack-empty-title: chinese ? "先选一个文件夹" : "Start with a folder";
    out property <string> archives-pack-empty-hint: chinese ? "文件夹里的文件会列在这里，勾选要打包的内容。\n压缩包里会保留这个文件夹本身，解压后依然是一个完整的文件夹。" : "The files in it are listed here: tick the ones to pack.\nThe folder's own name leads every entry, so unpacking gives the folder back whole.";
    out property <string> archives-footnote: chinese ? "所有处理均在本机完成  ·  单个压缩包最大 2 GiB / 20000 条目  ·  单次解压最多写入 16 GiB  ·  越界路径与符号链接一律拒绝  ·  从不覆盖已有文件  ·  暂不支持带密码的压缩包" : "Processed on your device  ·  Up to 2 GiB and 20,000 entries per archive  ·  One extraction writes at most 16 GiB  ·  Names that point outside the folder, and links, are refused  ·  Nothing is ever replaced  ·  Password-protected archives are not supported";
    out property <string> planned: chinese ? "开发计划" : "PLANNED";
    out property <string> planned-title: chinese ? "新工具正在准备中" : "A new tool is taking shape";
    out property <string> planned-hint: chinese ? "已有多个工具可以使用。\n此工具尚未实现，以下为计划支持的能力。" : "Several tools are ready today.\nThis tool is not implemented yet. Here is what is planned.";
