    out property <string> share-idle-hint: chinese ? "开始共享后，这个文件夹里的内容会显示在这里，\n同一网络下的设备可以取走，也可以放进来。" : "Once sharing starts, what is in the folder appears here —\nready for another device to take, or to add to.";
    out property <string> share-empty-title: chinese ? "还没有可共享的内容" : "Nothing shared yet";
    out property <string> share-empty-hint: chinese ? "把文件拖到窗口里，或在手机上打开上面的地址上传。" : "Drop files on this window, or open the address above on a phone and upload.";
